Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.56,0:00:05.85,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Must you tell me every thought that crosses your mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.15,0:00:08.82,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I've gotta tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.98,0:00:11.78,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Are you so unaware of how different our worlds are?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.07,0:00:14.96,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Then let's bring up a revolution!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.96,0:00:17.92,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Do you know? Who I am
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.92,0:00:20.95,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Yes, I know! That sky-high pride of yours
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.95,0:00:23.97,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}What you want? Tell me now!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.97,0:00:26.29,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}All I want! Only you!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.29,0:00:30.18,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how immersive this game may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.86,0:00:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, you have a feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.64,0:00:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're thinking of thinking.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.18,0:00:32.67,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Aren't you way too into it?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.67,0:00:34.30,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}If I do it differently,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.74,0:00:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not a baby!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.30,0:00:36.14,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}there won't be a happy ending
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.96,0:00:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's give you a true\Nfeeling. I hope you're who.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.14,0:00:38.55,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}What nonsense are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.74,0:00:42.06,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}My wildest fantasies became my reality…
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.06,0:00:44.56,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Ah, cool! You're cool! Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you hope you're who. Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.75,0:00:47.81,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Bringing such disruption to my once peaceful days…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm on, it's not a chance to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.14,0:00:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're who you,\Nyou hope you're who you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.15,0:00:50.57,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I can't believe! You have to leave!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.78,0:00:52.44,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Love and hate both,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're who you,\Nyou hope you're who you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.44,0:00:58.68,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Without a partner, those feelings can never start!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:01:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.29,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}So raise your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.54,0:01:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so much.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.29,0:01:05.08,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}It's time to give in to happiness!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.08,0:01:10.04,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}There's only one right choice here:
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.04,0:01:11.92,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}from the bottom of your heart, hold up and
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.92,0:01:14.67,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Raise your hands! Surrender already!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.67,0:01:17.97,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! Throw 'em up and celebrate!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.97,0:01:20.76,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! One more time!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.76,0:01:23.39,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! For this fantastic world!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.39,0:01:27.27,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I won't give up until you tell me what you're planning!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die until I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.74,0:01:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, yes, I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.27,0:01:30.11,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}You're so awesome! I love you!
