Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magic is a cutting-edge\Nfield of study in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.78,0:01:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like Revolution's version of IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's such a big deal here that a country's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,political standing depends\Non how well they use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.12,0:01:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Note, students,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.52,0:02:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that magic stones like this one are\Nthe foundation of every magic tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This magic wand, for example, was crafted\Nwith a magic stone at the top. In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was the stones that inspired early\Nmages to invent the magic tools we use.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.22,0:02:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's magic wielders can bring about all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.40,0:02:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorts of phenomena depending\Nupon their strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The greater and purer one's talent is, the\Ngreater the wonders they are capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, mining and distribution of\Nmagic stones is nationally regulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they are managed by the Aurousseau Company\Nwith the permission of the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As an aside, that's my Linnaeus household.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.34,0:02:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, during today's lesson, practice\Nfiring magic shots with your wands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.70,0:02:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your targets will represent monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to envision them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:02:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, there's more!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:03:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These stones are the reason there's\Nmonsters running around in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monsters were normal\Nanimals until they
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,decided to shove the\Nstones down their gullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now they're all buffed up and terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.68,0:03:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to get rid of a monster, you\Nhave to remove and destroy the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, Rey?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time I look over at\Nyou, you're spacing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.72,0:03:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing really, just\Ndaydreaming. Nothing indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.44,0:03:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand this may be review for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but even a dual caster\Nneeds to practice every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.64,0:03:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.78,0:03:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I can do a magic shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.82,0:03:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bippity-bubbity-boosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.18,0:03:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I always wonder what was\Nso great about dual casters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, I overshot or overstrengthened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:03:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.38,0:04:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm officially too OP to function!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.26,0:04:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting a bit overconfident, commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.58,0:04:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't take a dual\Ncaster to pull that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.52,0:04:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your tears of frustration\Nspeak for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your tears of awe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.40,0:04:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.31,0:04:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.23,0:04:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies, please, don't lose focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Professor Torrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.34,0:04:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magic can be fun, but it's a very\Ndangerous art if used incorrectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be sure to conduct\Nyourselves with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.65,0:04:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.40,0:04:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.14,0:04:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be a noble,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you're still able\Nto show true respect to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.92,0:04:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone who's in a position\Nof authority over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lady after my own heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.86,0:04:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I respect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.90,0:04:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Professor Torrid was\None of the pioneers who
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,established the foundations\Nof magic in this kingdom.
