Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.32,0:05:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he commands the attributes\Nof fire, earth, and water,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thus making him the kingdom's\None and only Tri-Caster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope this is not news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even commoners should know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, this commoner is aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our kingdom's magic was quite unimpressive
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until Professor Torrid\Nlaid down some moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hail the mother of magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you're doing,\Nstop it this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are making a public\Nspectacle of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.70,0:05:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is important to be familiar\Nwith the four attributes.
