Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every elemental attribute has a\Ndifferent element that it can counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earth is strong against wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wind is strong against water,\Nfire is strong against earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and water is strong against fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, it doesn't always\Nwork exactly like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:05:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are some exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make note, there are other ways in\Nwhich the attributes can be categorized.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.58,0:06:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example, you can use\Nearth magic to defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walls may be created\Nout of earth, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.66,0:06:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,advanced users can work on a larger scale,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.72,0:06:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crafting walls that\Nwould fortify a castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conversely, fire magic attacks
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and water magic heals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can be used to treat\Ninjuries and illnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, water can never be used\Nto bring the dead back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.46,0:06:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for our final attribute,\Nwind magic, which I cannot wield?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is used in supportive roles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Combining wind magic with fire\Nincreases its attack power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While combining it with water\Nincreases its healing capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And end tutorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.82,0:06:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, if there are no questions,\Nthen let's put this into practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have a wind attribute, come see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.88,0:07:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be working with you individually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An earth wall, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, not a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It warms my heart to see how\Nclose you two have become.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Rod! Prince you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you believe I have any kind of\Nrelationship with that ridiculous girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'm afraid you're\Ngratefully mistaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.34,0:07:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you aware of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.78,0:07:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her hatred keeps things spicy between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you please shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, where's, uh,\NPrince Thane? Oh, him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's over there with Professor Tord.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really destroyed that target earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've never been great at magic\Nourselves, so please forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We truly admire your skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kay, their Highness just\Ndeign to praise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you not grateful?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I mean, it's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.84,0:08:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your praise is what\Nmy heart truly desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you will never have\Nit, you imbecile! See?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.02,0:08:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Practically joined at the hip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which reminds me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you two ladies planning to take the\NAcademy Knights exam together next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.08,0:08:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would Ray know anything\Nabout the Academy Knights?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you have a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, allow me to\Ngive you the rundown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.60,0:08:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Academy Knights resolve\Nconflicts between students,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kill monsters on the grounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a self-governed\Norganization within the Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's deeply rooted in tradition, and only\Nthe elite who pass the exam can join.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.76,0:08:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it would be well\Nworth your while to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.28,0:08:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's really interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.48,0:09:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know about the Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, they were in the\Ngame, so why wouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They go by the name Knights, but\Nit's basically the student council.
