Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is no big whoop for me, so\NI really didn't care if I got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't seem very enthused right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.74,0:09:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured you of all people would\Njump at the chance to join up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine getting to say, Back Fiend, I'm\Nthe knight who protects Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be Ms. Claire's knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.94,0:09:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone please save me! My lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.78,0:09:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not ask what that was all about,\Nas I'm certain I'll be horrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course I will be\Ntaking the exam as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as a knight, I hardly think\NI'll need your protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's even better!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.72,0:10:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put me down this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't have someone protecting\Nme for the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady or not, I know how to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that looks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.16,0:10:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your first time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.98,0:10:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone else feel that shaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what is that? An earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.78,0:10:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a monster attack that\Nlooks like a water slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:10:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah and a huge one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.80,0:11:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they were to make contact\Nthere's no way we would survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and find refuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.38,0:11:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.54,0:11:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way. Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner, this is no time for your danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.36,0:11:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here! But wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.26,0:11:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Taylor, what do\Nyou think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That monster's a water type.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.82,0:11:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need wind magic to defeat it, and\Nit's not one of your attributes, is it?
