Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a monster attack\Nthat happens in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew this was coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I have been racking up my\Nmagic skills so I can slay all day.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:12.41,0:12:13.79,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\fn04b03\blur1\an4\fs85\c&HFFFFF5&\pos(192,126)}The water slime took 35 damage!
Dialogue: 2,0:12:13.79,0:12:14.67,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\fn04b03\blur1\an4\fs85\c&HFFFFF5&\pos(192,126)}The water slime took 38 damage!
Dialogue: 2,0:12:14.67,0:12:15.80,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\fn04b03\blur1\an4\fs85\c&HFFFFF5&\pos(192,126)}The water slime took 42 damage!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took a little getting used to,\Nbut it's nothing I can't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.22,0:12:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my sweet, sweet protags, Bex.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.02,0:12:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's weak enough to\Noverpower with numbers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.72,0:12:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell everyone to turn around and attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, I shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Students, when I give the signal, I\Nneed everyone to use their attack magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be sure to aim through the\Ncracks between the earth walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it! Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, false.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.46,0:13:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we did was set a flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to keep your ears covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monsters do this to threaten foes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called the Hateful Cry. Damn\Nit. I can't move. I won't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.82,0:13:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Prince Rod and Prince,\Nyou are immobilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.14,0:13:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we're not\Nsupposed to let that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.82,0:13:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I must have used up\Nall my magic on those walls!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, it's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is about to end up just\Nlike it does in the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.38,0:14:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole point of this stupid event is to
