Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.22,0:15:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hateful cry was so... hateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fear I'm in no condition to be of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.72,0:15:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stay strong, Claire Francois.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Dane, it's you!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.27,0:15:23.78,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnHiroshige\fs75\bord8\b0\c&HFCFFFF&\3c&HFCFFFF&\pos(295,740)}Damage
Dialogue: 2,0:15:21.27,0:15:23.78,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnHiroshige\fs75\bord0\b0\blur0.4\c&H17192B&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(295,740)}Damage
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.24,0:15:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit that monster with all\Nthe magic at your disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I would, but my attribute is fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.56,0:15:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I don't think it will do\Nmuch good against a water type.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.98,0:15:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be sure to hit it with full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there any other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not this time! Not this girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you caught me off\Nguard, but never again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that an angel I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.90,0:16:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or is that Miss Claire coming to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.30,0:16:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.02,0:16:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roar forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clad in the breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.48,0:16:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enchant wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.82,0:17:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.26,0:17:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such incredible work, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.83,0:17:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you took out that\Nenormous monster on your own in one hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.72,0:17:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I didn't do it on my own. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.46,0:18:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.88,0:18:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to be afraid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.76,0:18:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.42,0:18:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was your mommy in that\Nbattle back there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she was fighting to\Nprotect you, wasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.22,0:18:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about if I become your\Nmommy for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.52,0:18:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, we'll forge the familiar pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll call you Ralaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.66,0:18:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Ralaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.72,0:18:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, this tickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.72,0:19:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince Thane!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.98,0:19:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to say how grateful I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what would have\Nhappened if it weren't for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.80,0:19:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.84,0:19:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome, but you're quite skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would have survived without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.34,0:19:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.58,0:19:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You! Commoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.28,0:19:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me look, did it hurt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.36,0:19:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, oh, no, I'm just dandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:19:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that really the best idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.74,0:19:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.65,0:19:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.80,0:20:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you set the flag, then for some\Nreason, you went and snapped it in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.98,0:20:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not an appropriate\Ntime for your nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.70,0:20:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know how worried I was about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.98,0:20:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're finally showing\Naffection toward me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.24,0:20:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence, you're delusional!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you even get\Nsuch ridiculous ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.14,0:20:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, you did quite well for a commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I mean is, thank you for\Nkeeping that monster in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I very much appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too, Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's return to class, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't
