Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.38,0:21:24.85,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}The meaning behind your words is something I
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.48,0:21:28.65,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}And yet you continue clinging to me
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.65,0:21:29.38,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Stop it now!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.38,0:21:31.23,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}My word, even though I don't want you anywhere nearby
