Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.42,0:21:35.17,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Please, for all of eternity, I bid you,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.17,0:21:36.13,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}"Adieu!"
