Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.33,0:21:48.37,WataOshi ED,Mask,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\blur1\pos(0,0)\c&H6EACD9&\fscx100\fscy100\p1}m 661.33 924 l 662.67 917.33 668 912 674.67 906.67 680 904 1196 905.33 1205.33 909.33 1210.67 914.67 1213.33 921.33 1213.33 928 1212 958.67 1209.33 965.33 1205.33 972 1197.33 974.67 1185.33 974.67 682.67 974.67 674.67 973.33 669.33 970.67 664 965.33 661.33 960
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.34,0:21:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we'll use the truth right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.37,0:21:52.62,WataOshi ED,Mask,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\blur1\pos(0,0)\c&H7ACAFD&\fscx100\fscy100\p1}m 700 916 l 1197.33 918.67 1196 969.33 697.33 966.67
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.10,0:21:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll show you how you can do so.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.63,0:21:54.86,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how much I bully you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.56,0:21:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't want you all. We'll do so.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.86,0:21:56.20,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}It doesn't bother you at all...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.20,0:21:57.07,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}How infuriating!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:21:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.07,0:21:58.74,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Dear God, I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.72,0:22:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll do so.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.74,0:21:59.91,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}I'll make sure you understand my words:
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.91,0:22:02.70,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}It's your time to apologize, soul-search, and feel remorse...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.66,0:22:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do so.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.70,0:22:04.04,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Bow down to me!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.04,0:22:04.83,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.18,0:22:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.83,0:22:06.54,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Even if it's for a minute or just a second,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.54,0:22:07.50,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I won't let you get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.38,0:22:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are really right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.77,0:22:09.71,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}I mean, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.29,0:22:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will have to buy my wonder girl!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.71,0:22:13.67,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}She is my wonder girl of world!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.78,0:22:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be enjoying the truth.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.67,0:22:17.63,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}There has been no one like you in my world
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.63,0:22:21.60,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}So I'll make sure you know this:
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.60,0:22:23.35,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}No matter when or where,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.35,0:22:26.52,ed_eng_04_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}I'll be here to face off against you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.70,0:22:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a sec, I'm sure I\Nhave something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, who's a hungry little baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.94,0:22:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy there, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.44,0:22:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have plenty of time\Nto explore the world soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.88,0:22:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to finish growing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.92,0:22:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.72,0:22:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a monster, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.88,0:23:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't scream, Misha!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.02,0:23:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down and\Nlisten to me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.58,0:23:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm as calm as I can be right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.34,0:23:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need your help training\Nthis little friend I made.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.88,0:23:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're asking me to train a monster\Nas though we're discussing homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.72,0:23:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.18,0:23:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really cute! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.80,0:23:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, we won Misha over\Nwith the power of cuteness,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.52,0:23:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she helped me start a training\Nregimen for Little Ray Lair.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.62,0:23:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.20,0:23:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner, there you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.46,0:23:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know where you\Nplaced my hairbrush earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.80,0:23:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lene was looking for...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.88,0:23:31.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.42,0:23:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.84,0:23:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.06,0:23:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first part of the night\Nexam is the written part.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.60,0:23:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard it's the norm\Nto always get answers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.10,0:23:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,off by one when filling these things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.84,0:23:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is norm as in normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:23:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you referring to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.90,0:24:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we compare our answers?
